ecific key separation. Freeze all four comparison cells plus closest references for repeats before making stronger claims.',\n    'decision_if_not_supported':'If both query regimes gain similarly, report generic conditioning/regularization support only. If context improves more, reject target-specific explanation. Never infer source-paper transfer from this factorial.'}\n ],\n 'cost_plan':{\n   'estimate_ref':'Frozen protocol estimated_unit_seconds=704.3729729604242; g2-r0001-target_separate wall=646.8658979 s; g2-r0001-context_separate wall=675.6937546 s; latest four cells wall=654.46-664.99 s. Entry remaining_seconds=71629.0789308548; all preparation and checks remain charged.',\n   'all_variants_counted':True,\n   'attribution_reserve':'Four screening cells budget about 4*705=2820 s, including both replay controls and diagnostic work; pessimistic hard-cap exposure 4*1760.9324324010606=7043.73 s. Reserve another 4*705=2820 s for one discriminating attribution round, not unlimited tuning. No Torch execution, installations or training are permitted in this coding phase.',\n   'assessment_reserve':'Ring-fence at least 15*705=10575 s for a validation-only suite of all four factorial cells and baseline-din across paired seeds 42,43,44, conservatively counting seed-42 again unless matching hashes permit accepted-result reuse. Freeze selected sources/configs/checkpoints, closest controls and commands before final validation assessment; report any omitted repeats. No test data or closed assessment outputs are authorized.',\n   'stop_rule':'Host enforces remaining shared budget and per-trial cap 1760.9324324010606 s; all failed or unfinished calls count. Stop before reserves would be consumed or integrity cannot be preserved. No automatic retry for unknown execution state, no budget increase. Single-seed screening success is not scientific completion. This phase ends after proposal/source checks; host owns experiments.'\n }\n}\nvariants=[]\nfor name,target,semantic,role,de