ledge_id':'taac2026-academic-3-unitokenformer','decision':'unresolved',\n  'rationale':'The retrieved organizer card has no detailed original report/implementation or full ablation protocol. Prior declared non-adoption remains consistent with executed source changes; token-allocation attribution is unresolved.',\n  'transformed_mechanism':'None; preserve supplied 128-event limit and existing embedding/output dimensions, without learned token allocation, joint token projections or gated decoder.',\n  'variant_names':[],\n  'nearest_work_difference':'Tests field-key metadata inclusion at constant allocated capacity, not a token-budget mechanism.',\n  'falsifier':'No outcome here validates/refutes the source allocation claim. A detailed primary method and a capacity-matched local tokenization experiment would be required.'},\n {'knowledge_id':'taac2026-industry-2-unidot','decision':'considered',\n  'rationale':'Read archived primary arxiv:2608.16797v1 lines 163-207. Explicit interactions are existing prior art. Latest knowledge-usage declarations and unsuccessful local late-fusion trials establish no highway or bus-fusion benefit.',\n  'transformed_mechanism':'None adopted: the existing parent query-key product remains within the relation scorer; no new explicit interaction head is added.',\n  'variant_names':[],\n  'nearest_work_difference':'No FM Highway, Gram readout, dual buses, deep sequence gating, mutual learning, auxiliary delay supervision or optimizer intervention.',\n  'falsifier':'Local semantic-key gain would not support UniDot source transfer; local failure would not refute it. Only the proposed key-exclusion interpretation is tested.'}\n]\nproposal={'study':study,'parent_trial':'g2-r0001-target_separate','variants':variants,'knowledge_assessments':assessments}\nPath('/workspace/proposal.json').write_text(json.dumps(proposal,ensure_ascii=False,indent=2)+'\\\\n')\nprint('Wrote proposal.json with prospective study, four contrasts, budget reserves and three 